      "text": "WordPress Plugin\n(apps/wally/)\n\n· React Chat UI\n  (ChatSidebar, MessageList)\n· PHP REST Controller\n· Tool Executor (50+ tools)\n· Site Scanner (daily cron)\n· Audit Logger\n· Permissions (role-based)\n· Confirmation Flow\n· Snapshot System (undo)\n· Result Summarizer",
